OL,3,GNEWSA'Pivotal moment' as Swinney
OL,4,Aattends leaders summit
OL,5,
OL,6,FJohn Swinney has claimed the UK is at a
OL,7,F"pivotal moment of constitutional
OL,8,Fchange" - ahead of a summit with the
OL,9,Fleaders of Plaid Cymru and Sinn Fein in
OL,10,FCardiff.
OL,12,FSwinney, Plaid's leader Rhun ap
OL,13,FIorwerth, and Sinn Fein's president
OL,14,FMary Lou McDonald and vice-president
OL,15,FMichelle O'Neill, will discuss how the
OL,16,Fparties can work together on their
OL,17,Fshared interests.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,422,420,260,160,0,100
