OL,3,GNEWSA'Pivotal moment' as Swinney
OL,4,Aattends leaders summit
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe gathering marks the fact that, for
OL,7,Fthe first time, the three devolved
OL,8,Fgovernments are represented by three
OL,9,Fnationalist first ministers (although
OL,10,FO'Neill represents one half of
OL,11,FStormont's power-sharing
OL,12,Fadministration).
OL,14,FAll three seem keen to exploit this new
OL,15,Fpolitical dynamic. But the question is,
OL,16,Fhow exactly?
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
